  "contentHtml": "<p>1. <a href=\"https://srajagopalan.substack.com/p/psalm-happy-birthday-coltrane\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Shruti on Coltrane</a>.</p>\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://x.com/lucas_gortazar/status/2102637738155729198\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">On the drop in Pisa scores</a>.&nbsp; Quite exaggerated, it turns out.</p>\n<p>3. Hope you all reoptimize your views accordingly, <a href=\"https://x.com/kimmonismus/status/2103114317961015391\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">on AI agreements with China</a>.</p>\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://x.com/SanderTordoir/status/2102667805061759448\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dutch economy is picking up</a>.</p>\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/education/2026/09/23/nine-months-200-academic-papers-one-professors-ai-assisted-output/?pwapi_token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..KNN0IVrxf6GP4cyHQ_xKexOAgL7VmuyM14bThva2yj0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">One professor’s AI-assisted output</a>.&nbsp; Hey people, solve for the equilibrium…</p>\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/food/2026/09/22/top-texas-barbecue-restaurant-drops-brisket-amid-soaring-beef-prices/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Brisket is now too expensive for this Texas smokehouse</a>.</p>\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://claude.ai/share/82446d6d-eaf6-4b28-be36-553000a7d05c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">I asked the new Claude to write a 900-word column on refineries, supply, and how to improve the problem</a>.</p>",
